  "description": "The proposed works seek to enhance both the character and functionality of the property through the sensitive addition of a loft room, complemented by a thoughtfully designed shower room with integrated toilet facilities.\nRising gently into the roof space, the new loft room will offer a tranquil, light-filled retreat—an elevated sanctuary that balances comfort with refined simplicity. Carefully considered proportions and finishes will ensure the space feels both airy and intimate, seamlessly extending the home’s existing architectural narrative.\nAdjoining this, the shower room will be crafted with a focus on elegance and efficiency. Clean lines, quality materials, and a restrained palette will create a calming, contemporary environment, where practicality meets understated luxury. The inclusion of a toilet within this space ensures complete convenience, forming a self-contained and harmonious addition.\nTogether, these enhancements will not only increase the property’s usability but also enrich its sense of space, offering a quiet dialogue between modern living and timeless design.",
